<title>POLAND: KPW CLEARS ANIMEX NEW ISSUE FOR TRADE.</title>
<headline>KPW CLEARS ANIMEX NEW ISSUE FOR TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has cleared for public trade the 10-million-share new issue of food trader and producer Animex SA, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p> Tranches		  No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Large-investor	  8,000,000		October 15-17</p>
<p> Small-investor	  2,000,000		October 15-17</p>
<p> No of existing shares: 14,652,500</p>
<p> Lead Manager:	   IB Austria Securities</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:	broaden product base, modernise plant</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
